  [ 46] pushcons 8 .............................. <"hona">
  [ 48] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 50] pusharglist 1 ........................... <3>
  [ 52] extcall 44 .............................. <random(3)>
  [ 54] joinstr ................................. <"hona" & random(3)>
